```mdl
verdict DebugPanel: The panel is in parts with one Root context, a drawer host, a floating host and a shared header; the status button and dock/float switch work and state persists.
  status: done
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-debug/src/containers/DebugPanel/DebugPanel.tsx#DebugPanel, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-debug/src/containers/DebugPanel/DebugPanelHeader.tsx#DebugPanelHeader, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-debug/src/containers/DebugPanelDrawer/DebugPanelDrawer.tsx#DebugPanelDrawer, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-debug/src/containers/DebugPanelStatus/DebugPanelStatus.tsx#DebugPanelStatus]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-debug/src/containers/DebugPanel/DebugPanel.stories.tsx, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-debug/src/containers/DebugPanelDrawer/DebugPanelDrawer.stories.tsx, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-debug/src/containers/DebugPanelStatus/DebugPanelStatus.stories.tsx]
  walkthrough:
    - Root owns the selection, the open branches and the mode in the persisted view state. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-debug/src/containers/DebugPanel/DebugPanel.tsx#DebugPanel
    - The drawer host renders the panel in AppSurface.Drawer and closes the drawer when floating. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-debug/src/containers/DebugPanelDrawer/DebugPanelDrawer.tsx#DebugPanelDrawer
    - The status host toggles the drawer, or opens a FloatingPanel when the mode is floating. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-debug/src/containers/DebugPanelStatus/DebugPanelStatus.tsx#DebugPanelStatus
    - The header carries the dock/float switch and the drawer's close. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-debug/src/containers/DebugPanel/DebugPanelHeader.tsx#DebugPanelHeader
```

